## initiating cartographer
make sure initiating IMU and Lidar before starting cartographer

```bash
cd f1tenth_ws
source /opt/ros/humble/setup.bash
source ~/f1tenth_ws/install/setup.bash
ros2 launch robo_cartographer mapping.launch.py
```
## starting Lidar
```bash
cd f1tenth_ws
source /opt/ros/humble/setup.bash
source ~/f1tenth_ws/install/setup.bash
ros2 run urg_node urg_node_driver   --ros-args   -p ip_address:=192.168.0.10   -p ip_port:=10940
```
## recording map
```bash
ros2 service call /finish_trajectory cartographer_ros_msgs/srv/FinishTrajectory "trajectory_id: 0"

ros2 service call /write_state \
  cartographer_ros_msgs/srv/WriteState \
  "{filename: 'racetrack.pbstream', include_unfinished_submaps: true}"
```
## generating pgm+yaml map
```bash
ros2 run nav2_map_server map_saver_cli -f ~/f1tenth_ws/map/racetrack
```
## localization mode
```bash
ros2 launch robo_cartographer localization.launch.py \
    pbstream:=~/f1tenth_ws/map/racetrack.pbstream
```
## foxglove bridge
```bash
cd f1tenth_ws
source /opt/ros/humble/setup.bash
source ~/f1tenth_ws/install/setup.bash
ros2 launch foxglove_bridge foxglove_bridge_launch.xml
```
